- selected evidence: MudFlow `MI_FluidBlast_MudOpaque2`, BloodOrb `MI_FluidBlast_LiquidOpaque4_WPO`, Cube14 `MI_WetDecal`, Kettle2 `MI_Water_Kettle_Tint`, KettleSim `MI_KettleGreen`, LiquidSphere Clean/Plasma, `MI_Water_CausticsDemo_v2`, pool/waterfall/hose output families.
- Landscape actor는 없다. selected output의 runtime MID 값과 실제 렌더 결과는 `pending`.

